      "start": 0.33,
      "end": 1.84,
      "text": "Hey! How's everything going?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 18.5,
      "text": "Mostly yes for the main ingredients. Be careful with salt and spices though, scale those up a bit less and taste as you go."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 20.61,
      "end": 25.9,
      "text": "Strong flavors don't always scale evenly, and you can always add more. Taking it out is the hard part."
    },
