      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 30.75,
      "end": 35.73,
      "text": "No, but a much bigger pot will take longer to come to a simmer. Allow an extra hour or so."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 39.02,
      "end": 44.17,
      "text": "Ask the hall, they often have catering pots. Otherwise split it between two or three pans."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 54.7,
      "end": 60.7,
      "text": "Stew is a kind dish to start with. It reheats well, it's better the next day, and nobody minds seconds."
